cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6600166Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6611392Z ^[[0m
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6612299Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6613233Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6613636Z 
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6613988Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6614672Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6615008Z 
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6615215Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6616357Z    if you are ready to continue.
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6616776Z 
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6617495Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6618536Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6619382Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6619809Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6620004Z 
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6620216Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6620515Z 
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6620756Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6621205Z    can use Nix.
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6621367Z 
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6621488Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6621677Z 
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6622047Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6622520Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6626820Z 
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6627060Z I will:
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6627447Z 
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6627863Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
