cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6644441Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6645227Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6657288Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
cli (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.6657865Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
