conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:31.5429533Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
conformance-rebuild (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:31.5429988Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
