conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9133504Z ^[[0m
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9134378Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9135292Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9135673Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9136067Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9136822Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9137345Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9138161Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9139066Z    if you are ready to continue.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9139399Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9139983Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9141584Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9142396Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9143043Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9143441Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9143813Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9144224Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9144564Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9145258Z    can use Nix.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9145532Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9145827Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9146098Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9146661Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
