conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9153380Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:55:26.9153729Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
